phone, e-mail, and front desk reception; intelligently explaining to customers basic information about Federal Student Aid programs and processes; providing excellent customer service while maintaining confidentiality of students’ records appropriate to FERPA regulations; working closely with the Financial Aid Customer Service Team. Read more Student Facility Assistant Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Facilities Operations Student Employment Student Employee Help UMW Grounds keep campus beautiful! Collect recycling and trash from cans and toters around campus. Must be comfortable driving a university truck around campus. Must complete UMW Van Familiarization before starting. Read more STARS Ambassador - Center for STARS Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Registrar's Office Student Employment Student Employee The Center for STARS is seeking hardworking, organized, and self-motivated students to serve as STARS Ambassadors. Ambassadors assist with office operations, help plan events, and represent STARS at campus and community programs. This role provides an opportunity to connect with prospective and current students, share your UMW experience, and serve as a positive representative of the university. Read more Grounds Lead Worker Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Grounds Staff Full Time Support the Landscape & Grounds mission of maintaining the UMW landscape & grounds in a safe, neat, clean and aesthetically pleasing manner. The UMW Landscape & Grounds Department strives to provide exceptional service and a safe environment to the UMW community and visitors, while being an environmental steward in maintaining a beautiful and inviting university. Read more Customer Service Representative Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Financial Aid Staff Full Time The Customer Service Representative serves as the first point of contact for students, families, prospective students, and campus partners seeking information regarding financial aid programs, processes, and policies. Read more Contracts & Resourcing Manager Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Capital Outlay Staff Full Time The University of Mary Washington has an exciting opportunity to join our team as a Contracts & Resourcing Manager. Read more Women's Lacrosse Assistant Coach Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Lacrosse-Women's Staff Part Time The University of Mary Washington, an NCAA Division III institution located in historic and vibrant Fredericksburg, VA, is seeking a full-time Assistant Women's Lacrosse Coach. The assistant coach will support all aspects of the women's lacrosse program, including practice planning, game preparation, player development, recruiting, and day-to-day program operations. Responsibilities include fostering the academic, athletic, and personal growth of student-athletes; providing individualized skill instruction; assisting with game strategy and opponent scouting; and promoting a positive, competitive team culture. The assistant coach will collaborate with the head coach, athletic trainers, strength and conditioning staff, administrators, and other campus personnel to support the health, well-being, and success of student-athletes. Additional duties include assisting with team travel, equipment management, scheduling, recruiting operations, administrative responsibilities, and ensuring compliance with NCAA Division III, conference, and university policies while upholding the mission and values of University of Mary Washington Athletics. Read more Art History Adjunct Instructor Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Teaching (Instructional) Faculty Teaching Faculty For the Fall 2026 semester, we are looking for an instructor to teach ARTH 116 Global Art History I (prehistory – c. 1400 CE). Read more Men & Women's Swimming Assistant Coach Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Men's-Women's Swimming Staff Part Time The University of Mary Washington, an NCAA Division III institution located in historic and vibrant Fredericksburg, VA, is seeking a part time assistant coach for men's and women's swimming. Position may be renewed on a yearly basis at discretion of Head Coach. Graduate tuition remission may be possible after one year of employment. Coaching Athletic Assistant duties include, but are not limited to, assisting the head coach with practice and meet preparation and coaching, recruiting, academics, fundraising, and the off-season program planning along with transportation of athletes to and from off-site practice and competition sites. Read more Men & Women's Swimming & Diving Assistant Coach Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Men's-Women's Swimming Staff Part Time The University of Mary Washington, an NCAA Division III institution located in historic and vibrant Fredericksburg, VA, is seeking an assistant coach. Graduate tuition remission may be possible after one year of employment. Coaching Assistant duties include, but are not limited to, assisting the head coach with practice and meet preparation and coaching, recruiting, academics, fundraising, and the off-season program. Read more Intern, Career & Workforce Programs - RWALC Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Center for Career and Professional Development Student Employment Student Employee The Career and Workforce Programs Intern will support the Director of Regional Partnerships in planning, coordination, and execution of communication, activities, and events to increase student and employer readiness and expand work-based learning opportunities in the region.  This position offers hands-on experience in a professional higher education environment and opportunities to develop technical, organizational, and career-ready skills. Read more Police Officer Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 University Police/Public Safety Staff Full Time Performs law enforcement, crime prevention, security and related public safety functions within state controlled property. Read more HVAC Technician Lead Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 HVAC Staff Full Time The University of Mary Washington has an exciting opportunity to join our team as a HVAC Technician Lead. In this role, you will perform highly skilled repair, maintenance and/or installation of heating, ventilation, air conditioning, and refrigeration systems in one or more of the following modes: serves as project leader; serves as team leader and/or team member; works independently to provide senior-level HVAC work. Backup EMS technician and HVAC Manager in their absence and become gas fitter certified. Read more Biological Sciences Adjuncts Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 College of Arts and Sciences Teaching (Instructional) Faculty Teaching Faculty UMW is currently building a pool of potential applicants for adjunct faculty positions in Biological Sciences. Read more Building Attendant Lead Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Housekeeping Staff Full Time The University of Mary Washington is seeking a dedicated and motivated Housekeeping Lead Worker to join our Facilities team. In this role, you will provide leadership and support to the housekeeping team members by ensuring high standards of cleanliness, safety, and customer service across campus facilities. The Lead Worker will assist supervisor with training, and quality inspections while also performing routine housekeeping tasks. Read more Senior Carpenter Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Carpenter Shop Staff Full Time Performs highly skilled carpentry work in one or more of the following modes: serves as project leader; serves as team leader and/or team member; works independently to provide senior-level carpentry tasks. Read more Continuing & Professional Studies Adjuncts Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Center for Continuing & Professional Studies Teaching (Instructional) Faculty Teaching Faculty UMW is currently building a pool of potential applicants for adjunct faculty positions to provide instruction through the Continuing & Professional Studies Department. Course availability, requirements, and hours may vary. There may or may not be any positions currently available; however, you will need to submit an online application in order to be considered for any current or future openings. Applicants may be contacted if their qualifications match a need for a particular course.\n\nContent areas of high interest include, educator professional development, computer science, business and leadership, and personal enrichment. Read more Music Department Aide Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 College of Arts and Sciences Student Employment Student Employee Music Department Aides are involved in marketing, promoting, and managing department performances (including ushering or handing out concert programs) and assisting the music administrative team in organization and care of department facilities and resources. Read more Displaying all 19 entries Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Candidate Details"
