unity and visitors, while being an environmental steward in maintaining a beautiful and inviting university. Contracts & Resourcing Manager Fredericksburg, Virginia, United States, 22401 Capital Outlay The University of Mary Washington has an exciting opportunity to join our team as a Contracts & Resourcing Manager. Hear about jobs that are right for you? Sign up for job alerts Job Alert c6879aeb Finalize your job alert by selecting criteria from the dropdowns below. You can select multiple options from each dropdown by returning to the combobox and re-entering the list of options. Submit at the end to create your job alert. Departments Registrar's Office Registrar's Office Categories Student Employment Student Employment Employment Type Student Employee Student Employee First Name (required) 022d23a5 Last Name (required) 6a8afa23 Email (required) 9a6d6126 Send Please wait... Done Not You? Thank you Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Candidate Details Please choose the employment type(s)"
